Zombie Shark is a horror, science fiction, tv
movie film directed by Misty Talley.

3
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:21,000
A perfect getaway weekend turns into a nightmare for four friends who find
themselves fighting for their lives against an experimental shark.

4
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:06,000
In order to survive they must fight sharks, zombies, and shark zombies.

